{
  "id": "1TI.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1TI",
  "reference": "1 Timothy 4",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Spirit says clearly that some people will abandon the faith in later times; they will obey lying spirits and follow the teachings of demons. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Such teachings are spread by deceitful liars, whose consciences are dead, as if burnt with a hot iron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Such people teach that it is wrong to marry and to eat certain foods. But God created those foods to be eaten, after a prayer of thanks, by those who are believers and have come to know the truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everything that God has created is good; nothing is to be rejected, but everything is to be received with a prayer of thanks, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because the word of God and the prayer make it acceptable to God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you give these instructions to the believers, you will be a good servant of Christ Jesus, as you feed yourself spiritually on the words of faith and of the true teaching which you have followed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But keep away from those godless legends, which are not worth telling. Keep yourself in training for a godly life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Physical exercise has some value, but spiritual exercise is valuable in every way, because it promises life both for the present and for the future. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is a true saying, to be completely accepted and believed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We struggle",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "struggle",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; some manuscripts have",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "are reviled.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and work hard, because we have placed our hope in the living God, who is the Saviour of all and especially of those who believe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give them these instructions and these teachings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not let anyone look down on you because you are young, but be an example for the believers in your speech, your conduct, your love, faith, and purity. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Until I come, give your time and effort to the public reading of the Scriptures and to preaching and teaching. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not neglect the spiritual gift that is in you, which was given to you when the prophets spoke and the elders laid their hands on you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Practise these things and devote yourself to them, in order that your progress may be seen by all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watch yourself and watch your teaching. Keep on doing these things, because if you do, you will save both yourself and those who hear you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
